          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "There are birds nibbling the yummy fruits and veggies in the garden today, but that doesn’t stop Greta and Sunny from spending their day there too, learning all about red foods: strawberries, tomatoes, radishes and more, Their friends Spider, Worm, and Butterfly tell them the story of “Little Red Strawberry Hood”, they learn how to make Tangy Tomato Salsa, and they close out their rosy day with a game of “Red or Not Red.”",
